UPDATE companies SET description='Tova Industries LLC was founded in 1985 in Jeffersontown, Kentucky, as a manufacturer, packer, and distributor of dry food products. The company began with a focus on proprietary formulas and low-cost, high-quality manufacturing techniques.

Today the company operates as a dry food manufacturer offering custom formulation, packing, and distribution services. Its capabilities include clean-label production, high-protein and high-fiber formulations, plant-based protein development, and natural flavor and color conversion. The firm also produces its own branded lines such as Tova Farms and Carbquik Bake Mix.

Its customer base includes companies looking for private-label and co-manufactured items such as whole-wheat mixes, nutrient-enhanced blends, and complete plant-based meals.

