UPDATE companies SET description='Treasure Valley Steel, Inc. was founded in 1982 in Ontario, Oregon, and expanded its manufacturing footprint with a second facility in Boise, Idaho, in 2003. The company remains family-owned and operated, with ownership passing through the founding family; reviews reference an owner named BJ. From its start as a regional steel fabricator, it has grown to serve customers across the Treasure Valley and eastern Oregon from two locations.

The company produces metal roofing and siding panels in 22-, 26-, and 28-gauge steel, with baked-on paint finishes, Galvalume coatings, and a 24-gauge self-rusting Corten option. It stocks coil inventory and runs in-house machinery to custom-cut panels to exact lengths and fabricate matching trim pieces. For standing-seam projects requiring panels longer than 40 feet, Treasure Valley Steel offers on-site roll forming at the job site. Both locations maintain showrooms and provide delivery to surrounding service areas.

Customers include residential and commercial builders, roofing contractors, and individual homeowners. Its two locations in Boise and Ontario position it to serve southern Idaho and eastern Oregon markets.

Treasure Valley Steel emphasizes its family-owned structure, competitive pricing, and quick turnaround on custom orders as differentiators. The ability to roll-form long standing-seam panels on-site reduces shipping constraints, while stocked coil and in-house cutting allow rapid fulfillment for both small and large projects.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Metal roofing panel manufacturing", "Metal siding panel manufacturing", "Custom panel cutting to length", "Trim fabrication", "On-site roll forming (standing seam)", "Coil stocking and processing", "Delivery service", "Showroom sales"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Roofing", "Siding", "Cold-formed steel buildings"], "materials": ["Galvalume-coated steel", "Corten steel (self-rusting)", "Pre-painted steel (baked-on finish)", "Steel coil (22, 24, 26, 28 gauge)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated since 1982", "Two manufacturing locations in Boise, ID and Ontario, OR", "In-house custom cutting and trim fabrication", "On-site roll forming for standing seam panels over 40 feet", "Stocked coil in multiple gauges and finishes (baked-on paint, Galvalume, Corten)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in Ontario, OR in 1982 -> /about-us", "Expanded to Boise, ID facility in 2003 -> /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /about-us", "Manufactures metal roofing and siding products -> /", "Offers 22, 26, 28 gauge steel with baked-on paint, Galvalume, Corten finishes -> /about-us", "Custom cuts panels to length and fabricates trim -> /", "On-site roll forming for standing seam panels over 40 feet -> /services", "Delivery service to job sites -> /services", "Two locations: Boise, ID and Ontario, OR -> /", "Coil stock in multiple gauges and finishes -> /", "Showrooms at both locations -> /services", "Cold-formed steel building systems -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes