UPDATE companies SET description='Triad Semiconductor, Inc. is based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina. The company was launched over twenty years ago by founder Jim Kemerling, who serves as Chief Technology Officer. From its inception, Triad attracted a team of highly skilled analog and mixed-signal engineers from semiconductor firms to develop custom integrated circuit solutions.

Triad specializes in the design and development of high-performance custom ASICs (Application Specific Integrated Circuits) and Application Specific Standard Products (ASSPs). Its engineering focus spans analog and mixed-signal IC design, with capabilities extending to functional safety certification (ISO 26262) and aerospace and defense qualification (QML/MIL-PRF-38535). The company also offers expertise in silicon photonics and optical communication design.

Triad serves a range of industries including virtual and augmented reality, audio, automotive, medical, sensors, silicon photonics/optical communication, and aerospace and defense. Its Triad Micro Devices (TMD) line specifically addresses aerospace and defense applications.

The company emphasizes quality as a core differentiator, maintaining ISO 9001:2015 certification and a UL Certified Functional Safety Professional on staff. Triad states that its passion for creating analog and mixed-signal solutions for the real world drives its approach to continuous improvement and regulatory compliance, including conflict minerals reporting.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','QML/MIL-PRF-38535','ISO 26262 UL Certified Functional Safety Professional (CFSP) - Automotive']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom ASIC design", "Application Specific Standard Product (ASSP) development", "Analog and mixed-signal IC design", "Functional safety certification (ISO 26262)", "Aerospace and defense qualification (QML/MIL-PRF-38535)", "Silicon photonics/optical communication design"], "industries": ["Virtual Reality and Augmented Reality", "Audio", "Automotive", "Medical", "Sensors", "Silicon Photonics / Optical Communication", "Aerospace & Defense"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "QML/MIL-PRF-38535 qualified for aerospace and defense", "UL Certified Functional Safety Professional (ISO 26262) on staff", "Team of analog/mixed-signal engineers from world-leading semiconductor companies", "Triad Micro Devices (TMD) dedicated to aerospace and defense applications"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Winston-Salem, North Carolina -> db", "Founder: Jim Kemerling (Founder/CTO) -> /about-us", "Launched over twenty years ago -> /about-us", "Custom ASIC and ASSP development -> /", "Markets: VR/AR, Audio, Automotive, Medical, Sensors, Silicon Photonics/Optical Communication, Aerospace & Defense -> /about-us", "Triad Micro Devices (TMD) for Aerospace and Defense -> /about-us", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, QML/MIL-PRF-38535, ISO 26262 UL CFSP -> /quality", "UL Certified Functional Safety Professional on staff -> /quality", "Quality policy: contin