UPDATE companies SET description='True Weld Metal Fabrication operates from Aurora, Colorado, serving the Denver metropolitan area. The family-owned business began over two decades ago in a home garage and has grown into a mobile-and-shop operation providing welding and fabrication services across the region. The owner-operator personally oversees every job.

The shop specializes in mobile welding repairs and custom metal fabrication, including structural welding of beams, columns, and mezzanines to code, as well as aluminum (TIG and MIG), stainless steel, and mild steel fabrication. They produce gates, trailers, brackets, handrails, fences, and perform equipment and trailer repairs. Work is performed both in-shop and on-site via a 24/7 mobile response unit.

Recent projects include a trailer hitch repair for a residential customer, a custom driveway gate for a homeowner in Parker, and structural repairs on a warehouse mezzanine in Denver.

