UPDATE companies SET description='U.S. Packaging & Wrapping LLC is based in Austin, Arkansas. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it has established itself as a supplier of industrial packaging materials and equipment for businesses ranging from small operations to large manufacturing facilities.

