UPDATE companies SET description='Ullmer''s Dairy Equipment & Fabrication operates from Pulaski, Wisconsin. The company was founded in 1991 by Francis Ullmer, who began by selling a single bulk tank from his front yard. The business grew into a 10-acre inventory of used cheese-making equipment in Northeast Wisconsin.

