UPDATE companies SET description='The company produces flat wire, square wire, and custom profile shaped wire for a range of applications. Its in-house capabilities include custom tooling design and manufacturing at no charge, strand and batch annealing with inert gas options, heat treating, and packaging from spools under one pound up to 1,000-pound oscillated coils. United Wire can deliver continuous annealed lengths of 1,000 pounds without welds, and works with stainless steel, carbon, copper, cobalt, nickel alloys, and aluminum.

